          {
            "source_id": "jd-digital",
            "raw_sha256": "41a42945549a2cfb677b3c4d38bfaa90e1d5053c57c7d8941141eec84f305968",
            "block_id": "jd-digital:b0009",
            "text_range": [
              0,
              35
            ],
            "text": "注：注意事项中约定不适合退换的商品除外，特殊规则以商品详情页介绍为准。"
          },
          {
            "source_id": "jd-digital",
            "raw_sha256": "41a42945549a2cfb677b3c4d38bfaa90e1d5053c57c7d8941141eec84f305968",
            "block_id": "jd-digital:b0010",
            "text_range": [
              0,
              5
            ],
            "text": "售后流程："
          },
          {
            "source_id": "jd-digital",
            "raw_sha256": "41a42945549a2cfb677b3c4d38bfaa90e1d5053c57c7d8941141eec84f305968",
            "block_id": "jd-digital:b0011",
            "text_range": [
              0,
              96
            ],
            "text": "注：返修退换货时，属于质量问题的，请将生产厂家售后服务中心开具的检测报告（维修检验单据）、附件、说明书、发票、保修卡、购物凭证、包装、商品，一并返回京东办理返修退换货手续（电子发票无需返回）。"
          },
          {
            "source_id": "jd-digital",
            "raw_sha256": "41a42945549a2cfb677b3c4d38bfaa90e1d5053c57c7d8941141eec84f305968",
            "block_id": "jd-digital:b0012",
            "text_range": [
              0,
              5
            ],
            "text": "注意事项："
          },
          {
            "source_id": "jd-general",
            "raw_sha256": "fc02aadbeb9393abe176b07664424ce07ce693f8f1262a4aa4cb4aec5f0bc8bd",
            "block_id": "jd-general:b0001",
            "text_range": [
              0,
              20
            ],
            "text": ">\n> 京东自营售后服务\n下载该帮助文档"
          },
          {
            "source_id": "jd-general",
            "raw_sha256": "fc02aadbeb9393abe176b07664424ce07ce693f8f1262a4aa4cb4aec5f0bc8bd",
            "block_id": "jd-general:b0002",
            "text_range": [
              0,
              13
            ],
            "text": "京东售后的服务总则是什么？"
          },
          {
            "source_id": "jd-general",
            "raw_sha256": "fc02aadbeb9393abe176b07664424ce07ce693f8f1262a4aa4cb4aec5f0bc8bd",
            "block_id": "jd-general:b0003",
            "text_range": [
              0,
              67
            ],
            "text": "京东承诺符合以下情况，自客户收到商品之日起7日内可以退货，15日内可以换货，客户可在线提交返修申请办理退换货事宜。具体退换货标准如下："
          },
          {
            "source_id": "jd-general",
            "raw_sha256": "fc02aadbeb9393abe176b07664424ce07ce693f8f1262a4aa4cb4aec5f0bc8bd",
            "block_id": "jd-general:b0014",
            "text_range": [
              0,
              33
            ],
            "text": "（5）其他根据商品性质不适宜退货，经您在购买时确认不宜退货的商品。"
          },
          {
            "source_id": "jd-general",
            "raw_sha256": "fc02aadbeb9393abe176b07664424ce07ce693f8f1262a4aa4cb4aec5f0bc8bd",
            "block_id": "jd-general:b0015",
            "text_range": [
              0,
              17
            ],
            "text": "特别说明，以下情况不予办理退换货："
          },
          {
            "source_id": "jd-general",
            "raw_sha256": "fc02aadbeb9393abe176b07664424ce07ce693f8f1262a4aa4cb4aec5f0bc8bd",
            "block_id": "jd-general:b0016",
            "text_range": [
              0,
              20
            ],
            "text": "1.任何非京东出售的商品（序列号不符）；"
          },
          {
            "source_id": "jd-general",
            "raw_sha256": "fc02aadbeb9393abe176b07664424ce07ce693f8f1262a4aa4cb4aec5f0bc8bd",
            "block_id": "jd-general:b0017",
            "text_range": [
              0,
              19
            ],
            "text": "2.过保商品（超过三包保修期的商品）；"
          },
          {
            "source_id": "jd-general",
            "raw_sha256": "fc02aadbeb9393abe176b07664424ce07ce693f8f1262a4aa4cb4aec5f0bc8bd",
            "block_id": "jd-general:b0018",
            "text_range": [
              0,
              67
            ],
            "text": "3.未经授权的维修、误用、碰撞、疏忽、滥用、进液、事故、改动、不正确的安装所造成的商品质量问题，或撕毁、涂改标贴、机器序号、防伪标记；"
          },
          {
            "source_id": "jd-general",
            "raw_sha256": "fc02aadbeb9393abe176b07664424ce07ce693f8f1262a4aa4cb4aec5f0bc8bd",
            "block_id": "jd-general:b0019",
            "text_range": [
              0,
              39
            ],
            "text": "4.无法提供商品的发票、保修卡等三包凭证或者三包凭证信息与商品不符及被涂改的；"
          },
          {
            "source_id": "jd-general",
            "raw_sha256": "fc02aadbeb9393abe176b07664424ce07ce693f8f1262a4aa4cb4aec5f0bc8bd",
            "block_id": "jd-general:b0020",
            "text_range": [
              0,
              15
            ],
            "text": "5.其他依法不应办理退换货的。"
          },
          {
            "source_id": "jd-general",
            "raw_sha256": "fc02aadbeb9393abe176b07664424ce07ce693f8f1262a4aa4cb4aec5f0bc8bd",
            "block_id": "jd-general:b0021",
            "text_range": [
              0,
              64
            ],
            "text": "温馨提示： 在商品退货时，需扣除购买该商品时通过评价或晒单所获得的京豆及相应优惠，如账户京豆已使用，则从商品退款金额中相应扣除。"
          }
        ]
